  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Grant: Transport Sector Project Development Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Transport Sector Project Development Facility (PDF) will improve the startup efficiency for priority transport projects in roads, maritime and aviation sectors for funding by assisting the government transport agencies to prepare feasibility studies, detailed designs, and supporting initial procurement and safeguards activities.</narrative>
  </description>
